{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>His wife goes out with him.</b> Rashi explains: ״But who brought her in, etc.״ One must examine: his wife — we find; his sons, from where? And one may answer: regarding one who sells himself it is written ויצא הוא ובניו עמו, and where the court sold him we learn it by means of a gezerah shavah of שכיר שכיר. And for the one who does not have this gezerah shavah, it is merely a revelation of the matter [i.e., Scripture reveals what logic would already suggest]."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:33.808659262Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}